  "body": "Edge has a method `console.countReset(label)` which allows resetting a counter. This seems useful, and in general it's better to add console methods than remove them, in my opinion.\r\n\r\nIf we spec this we should make sure that its behavior with no arguments, or undefined, is the same as that is decided for `console.count()`. (For that, see #88.)",
